  m_text: "\nKill zombies to collect coins. After each wave, a shop will open where
    you can spend your coins to upgrade your abilities \u2014 health, speed, ammo,
    and fire rate.\nWatch out for the explosive barrels! They can wipe out a group
    of zombies instantly, but the explosion will hurt you too. Use them wisely.\nGood
    luck, survivor. "
